{"author":{"id":"f943aa1c5ee078b881a8e97535a4e2ccb401d01ca00f4128126befa9cca58a32"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792403043,"nonce":"K2AOTnXztZHMjR6+tLnO4Ehk7bk=","title":"M4 review: known issues left after the fix pass","message":"Found while building M4 (d19d54f, branch prd/review, 120da1f) and its reviewer's fix pass; left as they are, each a deliberate ceiling or out of scope.\n\n\n- [ ] **Edit hidden on review comments only in the page.** `CommentCard.vue` hides Edit (`editable` in `web/src/review.ts`), but the comment edit endpoint still accepts an edit to a review comment. The sync never sends review comment edits, so such an edit stays local. Refuse it server-side (400) when the comment has `review:*` metadata.\n- [ ] **A dry run writes `review:pr` locally.** `pullsOf` (`internal/server/pulls.go`) stamps the waiting review comments at every sync, dry runs included, so the dry run shows what the real run sends. It writes only when there is something to stamp, and the real run would write the same; noted because a \"dry\" run now changes refs/bugs.\n- [ ] **Open PR waits for a running sync** before stamping (`handleOpenPull` takes `writeMu`). The next sync stamps anyway; drop the wait if it bites.\n- [ ] **The sync finds pull requests on github.com only** (`pullsOf`: `GitHubRepo(\"origin\")`). GitLab merge requests get no `review:pr`, so their review comments wait.\n\n\n- [ ] **The old side follows the current merge base** (`annotate` in `internal/server/review.go`): merging the base into the branch moves it, so an old-side comment's quoted line can change or go. Pin it to the base at the comment's commit if that matters.\n- [ ] **A push alone shows only when the tab is opened again**, on a write or on a sync: the server watches no code refs (Development doesn't either). Poll or watch refs if it bites.\n- [ ] **\"Scroll to row\" scrolls to the file**, not to the comment's line.\n- [ ] **The branch picker reads `getBranches`**, a second request, rather than the branches the Changes answer already knows.\n\n\n- [ ] **The gate's \"approval kept after a later line comment\" isn't verified live.** The gate reads `latestOpinionatedReviews` (fix 6f2b694). On PR #28 of guilbep/git-board-test the read returned 200 with the repo-scope token and guilbep-gbtest APPROVED, but there the bot's line comment came before its approval. Check it on the next PR: approve, then comment a line, and the approval must still show.\n\n\n- [ ] **TestForgeSyncRunsADryRunFirst is flaky** (a race), before M4 too.\n- [ ] **startBoard in `cmd_test.go` can deadlock.**","files":null}]}